Description: CVE-2026-78409 - X-mount.subdir symlink escape on detached tree
 open_tree() follows intermediate symlinks, so X-mount.subdir can escape
 the newly mounted filesystem. Add ul_openat_resolve()/mnt_open_tree()
 helpers and resolve the subdir with RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS|RESOLVE_BENEATH.
 Also strip a leading '/' so the path stays relative to the tree fd.
 .
 The v2.42 hook_mount.c detached-tree path is not in 2.41.5; the equivalent
 open_tree() site in hook_subdir.c is updated instead.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/ed072cf2297b68f86af8e08209907f605dd42e5d
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/4cccf4edc256507734e3484cfaedf5980945c2fa
