Description: CVE-2026-78410 - pin source path with openat2 for restricted users
 Restricted bind mounts resolve the source via open_tree() which follows
 intermediate symlinks. Pin the path with mnt_open_tree(RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS)
 so a user cannot redirect SUID mount(8) / X-mount.owner to an arbitrary
 inode.
 .
 Debian 2.41.5-0+deb13u1 already contains the companion restrict-source
 canonicalization commit (e554245 / b21f4cee). This patch adds the pin
 half (fb8e265 / 9fcb98bf).
